  "definition": "Surety Bond",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-06-26",
  "historyNote": "#7142, eff 11-24-99, EXPIRED: 11-24-07 New. #9878-A eff 2-25-11, EXPIRED: 2-25-19 New. #12815, eff 6-26-19",
